OL,3,GNEWSABaxters fish soup recalled over
OL,4,Afears cans could swell and burst
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe company, based in north-east
OL,7,FScotland, said the issue may affect the
OL,8,F400g cans with batch code L07XC and an
OL,9,FApril 2029 best before date.
